{"reviewId": "290006178_806WkwUVh", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "这个图很关键啊，对我们现在很有参考意义。美国TFP最低点就是萧条期结束点，在1982年之后出现了汽车和计算机，TFP走出低谷明显增长，带动经济繁荣。我们要想走出现在这波漫长的萧条期，需要出现重大技术革新，普遍认为是AI和新能源，目前这些领域已经有了很大的突破，但愿能再快一点吧。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "10161-10247", "abstract": "在第四次康波中，美国的全要素生产率在1966年附近到达高点，这正是康波繁荣的顶点，在经历了波动之后，全要素生产率的低点出现在1982年，即第四次康波萧条的结束点（见图1-8", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "reviewId": "290006178_806WkwUVh", "userVid": 290006178, "topics": [], "createTime": 1747115085, "userEditTime": 1747280607, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 290006178, "name": "yyds", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-AqDafFhKTQQoe2oNxRSWEeb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "yyds", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "只需真实，不必完美", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202412-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 48, "likes": [{"userVid": 6606216, "name": "是舟舟呀", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELgeicG21XDfO1gqkhkUMg2T6ibavWNh3FY3AIoz8T3812R8mxZt5D9CoboZZiarzQR5oZsTl3jibWXmThCDs9qTaHBXJJvAUNBaBCt0ZSJ5K8ucw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "是舟舟呀", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-50", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 50}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [{"content": "那就不好说了，AI算智力变革。我不希望它再搞快点。人类总是搞些先污染，再治理，AI再那么搞，